/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Even in such a heavenly place, there are those who decide everything in the \u201cunderground\u201d.</strong><br><i>They have completely different principles and ideas. &quot;Lady Junk&quot; is one of them... she will guide you <br>and teach a lot of unusual things in this world and immerse you in the relationships of different factions.</i><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2094570/extras/429f18af81abe2025786179cebf22801.poster.avif?t=1739747683\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2094570/extras/429f18af81abe2025786179cebf22801.webm?t=1739747683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2094570/extras/429f18af81abe2025786179cebf22801.mp4?t=1739747683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Especially for you, this girl is going to organize epic races on the beach and competitions with radio-controlled cars.</strong><br><i>Think you are the best racer!? You enter the turn perfectly!? Masterfully control the joystick!? - So prove it... <br>Speed \u200b\u200bcompetitions, rallies and free roam are all waiting for you when Keiko prepares tournaments and competitions for you!</i><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2094570/extras/84a387bc2049b49aae25d4c9e5733f69.poster.avif?t=1739747683\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2094570/extras/84a387bc2049b49aae25d4c9e5733f69.webm?t=1739747683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2094570/extras/84a387bc2049b49aae25d4c9e5733f69.mp4?t=1739747683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Business has always been a part of life, including beach holidays.</strong><br><i>This dude rose from the bottom and set up his shop in the most cereal place. Who is this Taehyung Kun!? <br>Just get adventurous or his connection with other more powerful people will do well for his cause.</i><br><br><strong><u>During the day you are left to your own devices, on a crowded beach with gorgeous girls.<br>Foam parties await you at night.</u></strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2094570/extras/2ba5d474bfdc069962c40a85f443a117.poster.avif?t=1739747683\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2094570/extras/2ba5d474bfdc069962c40a85f443a117.webm?t=1739747683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2094570/extras/2ba5d474bfdc069962c40a85f443a117.mp4?t=1739747683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>What kind of beach does without bars, restaurants and barmaids... </strong><br><i>Loona Tarhoon is at your service, she is who sees everything that happens and what condition the bar visitors are in. <br>She pours lemonade and prepares cocktails. But do not try to buy something alcoholic from her if you are under 18 years old.</i><br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2094570/extras/edd01b06e10a0d93e1133b429d3eca6d.poster.avif?t=1739747683\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2094570/extras/edd01b06e10a0d93e1133b429d3eca6d.webm?t=1739747683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2094570/extras/edd01b06e10a0d93e1133b429d3eca6d.mp4?t=1739747683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></