re lucky to find out her phone number, make friends or become enemies, and maybe even start a relationship!</i><br><br><strong>But be careful</strong> - because you as a guy, are not a welcome guest on this beach!<br><br><br>As you stay on the beach, and as visitors become dissatisfied with your stay, you run the risk of finding yourself in a situation where everyone will try to kick you out of this place. <br>Lifeguards will come to the aid of beach girls, who will throw you out of this place without any caresses.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2094570/extras/e04a8ea764bb33c385b576403a5045c1.poster.avif?t=1739747683\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2094570/extras/e04a8ea764bb33c385b576403a5045c1.webm?t=1739747683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2094570/extras/e04a8ea764bb33c385b576403a5045c1.mp4?t=1739747683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>If you are tired of shooting photos and communication, there are always got a mini games at your disposal that, you can immerse yourself in on this beach ... play the piano, control cars (with remote control), draw on the board and so...<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2094570/extras/18da39ba5c5783b3e0aa192fce6426fc.poster.avif?t=1739747683\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2094570/extras/18da39ba5c5783b3e0aa192fce6426fc.webm?t=1739747683\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2094570/extras/18da39ba5c5783b3e0aa192fce6426fc.mp4?t=1739747683\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Good luck and good 